    {
      "id": "iq53p1p",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9.2 Important Research Institutions"
    },
    {
      "id": "7kr34ks",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Indian Institute of Advanced Study (IIAS): At Viceregal Lodge, Shimla; interdisciplinary research in humanities and social sciences.",
        "Central Potato Research Institute (CPRI): Shimla; national institute for potato research; important for HP's potato economy.",
        "Botanical Survey of India (BSI) HP Circle: Shimla; plant taxonomy and biodiversity.",
        "HP Council for Science Technology and Environment (HIMCOSTE): State science and technology body.",
        "Wildlife Institute of India (WII): Field stations in HP for Snow Leopard and bird research.",
        "Forest Research Institute (FRI) Dehradun: Has field operations in HP.",
        "G.B. Pant National Institute of Himalayan Environment: Kosi-Katarmal; Himalayan ecology research.",
        "National Remote Sensing Centre (NRSC): HP applications for land-use mapping and glacier monitoring.",
        "IHBT (Institute of Himalayan Bioresource Technology), CSIR: Palampur; aromatic plants, biotechnology.",
        "HP Ayurveda and Drug Research Establishment: Promotes Sowa Rigpa (Tibetan traditional medicine) in Spiti."
      ]
    },
